$clip — combine images and sounds into video (legacy stub)

SUMMARY
  Lightweight placeholder for a clip composer: records which images[] and
  sounds[] were present and appends one emulated MP4 to videos[]. Prefer
  $image_clip for real slideshow + audio muxing.

SYNTAX
  $clip

INPUT
  images[], sounds[] — referenced in the stub output only.

OUTPUT
  videos[] — one emulated .mp4 link.

BEHAVIOR
  Does not read file bytes or call ffmpeg. Use $image_clip when you need
  a timed slideshow matched to audio length.

EXAMPLE
  @out: (@images, @music) -> $clip

PROMPT-CONSUMING
  No.
